                        "sense_id": "1aad2964-5588-3507-a815-cd06f1d02b8e",
                        "entry_id": "ef84af72-2e6a-3f89-89eb-9bd3d9bdadb3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A toxin that specifically acts upon neurons, their synapses, or the nervous system in its entirety."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3abc85b-91cd-435d-9ee3-12a7ec08f42d",
                                "sense_id": "1aad2964-5588-3507-a815-cd06f1d02b8e",
                                "text": "There were stretches of days when the lakes were closed because of the algae. It sometimes secreted neurotoxins that could be fatal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27685924-79ae-4e9c-8739-341d944708d5",
                                "sense_id": "1aad2964-5588-3507-a815-cd06f1d02b8e",
                                "text": "Among those who think of fugu as merely a distant delicacy, knowledge rarely goes beyond the fish’s infamous trait: In the most delicious species, the innards are suffused with the neurotoxin called tetrodotoxin (TTX)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
